ically detect constraint proximity and decelerate/queue up before bottleneck nodes in proportion to waiting times.\\n- **Pulsing Constraint Beacon**: Identified bottleneck stations emit a pulsing radar ring and red glow aura (`#f43f5e`), while normal stations emit clean emerald or amber tones.\\n- **Scales Across Topologies**: Automatically adapts between 3 stations (Model 1, Model 2) and 13 stations (Model 3).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. 3D Profitability Optimization Frontier (Tab 4)\\n- **Multidimensional Response Landscape**: A 3D continuous surface plot computed across 400 parameter combinations (20x20 grid of scrap reduction % vs bottleneck idle reduction %).\\n- **Interactive Global Frontier**: Judges can rotate, pan, and inspect the continuous profit surface with an obsidian-to-ice-cyan executive colorscale.\\n- **Real-Time Operating Point Marker**: A glowing red diamond marker dynamically tracks the exact `(Scrap %, Idle %, Net Margin $)` position as the What-If sliders are adjusted.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Executive Classy UI Polish\\n- **Modern Navigation Tabs**: Custom pill-shaped tab bar with subtle glowing gradient active indicators.\\n- **Frosted Glass Cards**: Elevated container cards with soft radial backdrops and hover transitions.\\n- **High-Contrast Sliders**: Crisp cyan progress fill with glowing thumb handles and JetBrains Mono value pills.\\n- **No Emojis Policy Enforced**: 100% clean typography and badge indicators across the entire codebase.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Verification Results\\n- All modules verified and compiled cleanly with `py_compile`.\\n- Live smoke test completed against Model 1 (sequential) and Model 3 \n<truncated 132 bytes>","Description":"\"Walkthrough of new features\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\win-10\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough artifact\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
