{"step_index":1373,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:36:52Z","content":"The platform's visual design has been upgraded to an **executive-grade industrial aesthetic**:\n\n---\n\n### Key Visual Upgrades\n\n1. **Obsidian Industrial Canvas**\n   - Refined midnight background (`#070b14`) layered with subtle dual ambient glows (ice-blue `#38bdf8` and indigo `#6366f1` at 5–7% opacity) and a micro-dot matrix grid.\n\n2. **Titanium Metallic Headlines & Accented Typography**\n   - Major headings now render with a metallic gradient (`#ffffff` -> `#e2e8f0` -> `#38bdf8`).\n   - Every section heading (`h4`) features an integrated glowing cyan accent marker.\n\n3. **Frosted Glass Cards with Inner Glow**\n   - Deep frosted glass containers (`backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`) with subtle 1px hairline borders (`rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14)`) and hover elevation shadows.\n\n4. **Segmented Pill Navigation Tabs**\n   - Clean obsidian tab container with pill indicators.\n   - Active tab highlighted by an executive cyan/indigo gradient with soft ambient luminescence.\n\n5. **High-Impact Executive Stat Cards**\n   - Color-coded top glowing accents (Emerald, Rose, Amber, Purple, Sky Cyan).\n   - High-contrast numbers in JetBrains Mono (`#f8fafc`) with hover lift transitions.\n\n6. **Tactile Industrial Buttons & High-Contrast Sliders**\n   - Tactile gradient buttons with subtle edge sheen.\n   - High-contrast What-If sliders with glowing progress rails and porcelain circular handles.\n\n7. **Strict Compliance**\n   - **Zero emojis** throughout the UI and codebase.\n   - Title strictly branded as *\"Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform\"*.\n\n---\n\nTo run the updated application:\n```powershell\nstreamlit run app.py\n```"}
