{"step_index":1375,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:41:15Z","thinking":"\"Ease out on the modern part and make it more classy\" implies a move away from over-saturated, futuristic aesthetics. This means reducing elements like glowing accents, excessive animations, and high-contrast cyberpunk styling. The goal is to shift towards a more authentic, refined visual style.\n\n\nThe aesthetic should evoke a sense of calm, refined luxury reminiscent of high-end financial interfaces and premium product design. Visual cues will be drawn from the Bloomberg Terminal, Apple Pro, Porsche Design, Financial Times, and Swiss Design for a unified and sophisticated approach. The design requires a desaturated color palette, subtle borders, and understated typography to emphasize clarity and professionalism.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\win-10\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\neurax_app\\\\app.py\"","EndLine":"250","StartLine":"60","toolAction":"\"Viewing app.py CSS start\"","toolSummary":"\"Inspect current CSS\""}}]}
